      "created" : "2014-07-13T16:57:43.000-0400",
      "creator" : {
         "accountId" : "557058:4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
         "accountType" : "atlassian",
         "active" : true,
         "avatarUrls" : {
            "16x16" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png",
            "24x24" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png",
            "32x32" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png",
            "48x48" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png"
         },
         "displayName" : "Lewis Pringle",
         "self" : "https://stroika.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
         "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
      },
      "customfield_10001" : "1_*:*_1_*:*_234387700362_*|*_5_*:*_1_*:*_0",
      "customfield_10012" : "0|i0005j:",
      "customfield_10027" : "26",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : ">>> REDOCUMENT WHY WE HAVE THIS – AND PROBABLY DON’T LOSE BUT DOCUMENT ONE WAY OR OTHER OTHER WHERE WE DECLARE ITERATOROWNER!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "“ITERATOR CONCEPTUALLY ITERATING OVER ITERABLE. THING ITERATING OVER NOT LOGICAL TO LOSE. BUT magic with reps is HIDDEN. Sharedptr stuff is just to do that hidden rep sharedptr magic”",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "PROBBALY LOSE ITERATOROWNER SUTFF                 /*",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "NB - the suggestedOwnerID argument to MakeIterator() may be used, or ignored by particular subtypes",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "of iterator/iterable. There is no gaurantee about the resulting GetOwner() result from the",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "iterator returned.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "*",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "\\em Design Note",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "It might have been better design to make the argument to Iterable<T>::Rep::MakeIterator ()",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "be owner instead of suggestedOwner, and then require that it get tracked. But that would",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "have imposed a memory (and copying) overhead on each iterator, and the current",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "use cases for iterators dont warrant that.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "*",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "I think its good enough that particular subtypes - where tracking an owner makes sense and",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  },
                  {
                     "content" : [
                        {
                           "content" : [
                              {
                                 "text" : "is useful, we be done. And when not useful, it can be optimized away.",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "*/",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              },
                              {
                                 "type" : "hardBreak"
                              },
                              {
                                 "text" : "virtual Iterator<T>         MakeIterator (IteratorOwnerID suggestedOwner) const                         =   0;",
                                 "type" : "text"
                              }
                           ],
                           "type" : "paragraph"
                        }
                     ],
                     "type" : "listItem"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "bulletList"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "•\tBut thinkout carefully, and probably do one single remove in one commit so easier to REVERT if I decide I was wrong…",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
